# Default list resting at its top with the header: pull-to-refresh that finds new posts, a
# pull whose response races a burst of prepends, and a scroll back up into a refresh.
route Feed
latency 400,900
wait 2
mark pull-at-top
pan 200 200 0 420 600
wait 4
mark publish-then-pull
press 296 80
wait 0.2
statusbar
wait 1.5
pan 200 200 0 420 600
wait 4
mark pull-with-burst
statusbar
wait 1.5
pan 200 200 0 420 600
repeat 3 press 296 80
wait 5
mark scroll-down-up-pull
pan 200 700 0 -400 300
wait 1
pan 200 150 0 650 200
wait 0.1
pan 200 200 0 420 600
wait 5
